meta {
  name: Get Game Price
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

get {
  url: {{backendUrl}}/api/games/220/price
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

docs {
  The GG.deals prices of a Steam App ID: the lowest current and the
  lowest ever price in the official stores (retail) and in keyshops, with
  their currency and the GG.deals page of the game (see
  docs/PRICE_TRACKING.md). Serves a cached row (refreshed at most every
  three hours) rather than always asking GG.deals, with the caller's own
  GG.deals key or else the server's. 503 when there is no key and no
  cached row, or GG.deals fails and there is no cached row. Run
  auth/Login first.
}
